EstablishmentDetail.RightToReply:
&lt;h2&gt;
	I agree with the inspection results but have since carried out the following improvements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;
	The establishment has been thoroughly cleaned and procedures are in place to ensure that cleanliness is maintained&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	We have done quite a lot to maintain every thing up to date and I will try my best to keep it up to date thanks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;
	The conditions found at the time of the inspection were not typical of the normal conditions maintained at the establishment&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	They were few points about food handling we have tried our best to keep it up to standard&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;
	The conditions found at the time of the inspection were not typical of the normal conditions maintained at the establishment&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	Ongoing maintenance works resulted in no hot water to staff WC from a recent flood and then flooring replacement. Hot water in all 3 kitchen sinks were working correctly at the time.&lt;br /&gt;
	Staff WC hot water back on the following working day&lt;/p&gt;
